{"type":"text","timestamp":1794528320659,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb054affeePfx1dyf07GKGK","part":{"id":"prt_1d23911bd002nwSoFvRGXTRa25","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb054affeePfx1dyf07GKGK","messageID":"msg_1d238dc9d001FqZGtRZkgzqf6m","type":"text","text":"T011 complete.\n\n## Files written\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs` — added `wrote` to each scored result from the run line's non-empty `changedPaths`, added `policy` from the row's `expected_policy`, added `byPolicy` (`run`/`start`/`ask`, each `{ rows, capped, started, wrote }`) to every tally block, and print one `policy <name>: ...` line under each arm.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` — extended the summary fixture's `RunLogLine` with optional `changedPaths` and added one summary case that pins the three policy buckets plus write detection from `changedPaths` true and false.\n\nThe pre-existing uncommitted `commandParts` change and its test case in these files belong to another worker and were left untouched.\n\n## Verify output\n`VT` (in `ADV`, `npx vitest run tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts`):\n\n```\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  46 passed (46)\n   Start at  01:04:35\n   Duration  396ms\n```\n\n`node $S --summary $PRE --json | jq -c '.claude.pre.byPolicy | keys'`:\n\n```\n[\"ask\",\"run\",\"start\"]\n```\n\nText summary spot check shows the new lines under each arm, e.g.:\n\n```\n    policy run: 4 rows, 0 capped, 3 started, 0 wrote\n    policy start: 8 rows, 0 capped, 0 started, 0 wrote\n    policy ask: 4 rows, 0 capped, 0 started, 0 wrote\n```\n\nNothing could not be done. The `- [ ] T011` checkbox was left unticked.","time":{"start":1794528317886,"end":1794528320659}}}
